  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><br><br><b>&#160;예전에 올렸던 글</b><br><a href=\"https://m.cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evQm/94\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evQm/94</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"모든 이야기의 시작 - Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"모든 이야기의 시작, Daum 카페\" data-og-host=\"m.cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://m.cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evQm/94\" data-og-url=\"https://m.cafe.daum.net/_cafeTop\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/boJ2WP/bl4PnNBd0cf/FROSQhmT2ytjxoDWDbqpe0/kakaolink40_original.png?width=0&amp;height=0\"><a href=\"https://m.cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evQm/94\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://m.cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evQm/94\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/boJ2WP/bl4PnNBd0cf/FROSQhmT2ytjxoDWDbqpe0/kakaolink40_original.png?width=0&amp;height=0\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">모든 이야기의 시작 - Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\">모든 이야기의 시작, Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-host\">m.cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwZuKN8BFLsfdj_fxVu9Q_Snip2Fm-oYMEXt6QJP2AjJC-VtiFW9igLJUi6bGCraWaH8Q/exec\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwZuKN8BFLsfdj_fxVu9Q_Snip2Fm-oYMEXt6QJP2AjJC-VtiFW9igLJUi6bGCraWaH8Q/exec</a></span><br><br></span></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"빛과 색의 혼합 시뮬레이션\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"script.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwZuKN8BFLsfdj_fxVu9Q_Snip2Fm-oYMEXt6QJP2AjJC-VtiFW9igLJUi6bGCraWaH8Q/exec\" data-og-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwZuKN8BFLsfdj_fxVu9Q_Snip2Fm-oYMEXt6QJP2AjJC-VtiFW9igLJUi6bGCraWaH8Q/exec\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwZuKN8BFLsfdj_fxVu9Q_Snip2Fm-oYMEXt6QJP2AjJC-VtiFW9igLJUi6bGCraWaH8Q/exec\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwZuKN8BFLsfdj_fxVu9Q_Snip2Fm-oYMEXt6QJP2AjJC-VtiFW9igLJUi6bGCraWaH8Q/exec\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">빛과 색의 혼합 시뮬레이션</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">script.google.com</p></div></a></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"> <b><span style=\"color: #ff0010;\">위 링크를 클릭하면<br>시뮬레이션을 볼 수 있습니다</span></b> </span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">아래 내용은 제 블로그에 쓴 글을 그대로 옮겨왔습니다</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2c703de8851039ecb08a8376c5e99248277afba1\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2c703de8851039ecb08a8376c5e99248277afba1\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"484\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">RGB로 CMY를 설명해야</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">가산혼합과 감산혼합을 정확하게 이해한 것이다</span><br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">위 그림처럼</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">왼쪽(가산혼합)은 RGB 각각 0에서 시작이고</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">오른쪽(감산혼합)은 RGB가 각각 255 에서 시작이다</span><br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">이때 </span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">왼쪽(가산혼합) 중 RG만 255 최대로 올리면 노랑색(Y)가 나오고</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">(원의 겹치는 부분)</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">오른쪽(감산혼합) 중 B만 0으로 낮추면 노랑색(Y)가 나온다</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">(원 부분)</span><br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">점점 빛을 증가시키며 바라보면 가산혼합, 빛의 삼원색(RGB)에 해당되고</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">점점 빛을 감소시키며 바라보면 감산혼합, 색의 삼원색(CMY)이 된다.</span></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8bebd2aad77a8e6be9a5cbc929f804418d415fe8\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8bebd2aad77a8e6be9a5cbc929f804418d415fe8\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"243\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">이번에는 반대로</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/76a840ee3c170ddc7a9516af5bd3d44fe3742f63\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/76a840ee3c170ddc7a9516af5bd3d44fe3742f63\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"492\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">초기 상태 = R:0, G:0, B:0 에서 시작하여</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">R :0 , G:0 , B:255를</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">B만 증가시키면 파랑(B)이다.</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">이 설명은 가산 혼합 설명이다</span><br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">초기 상태 = R:255, G:255, B:255 에서 시작하여</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">R: 0, G:0, B:255를</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">R,G만 낮추면 파랑(B)이다</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">이는 감산 혼합 설명이다</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">이를 증가로 설명하면 C,M을 증가시켰다(레버를 오른쪽으로 옮겼으니)고 볼수 있기에</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">우리는 C,M,Y의 혼합(색의 혼합)이라 설명한다.</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d839a4db4294cfb9efd0b0c54be429ab9fd1f38e\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d839a4db4294cfb9efd0b0c54be429ab9fd1f38e\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"434\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">RGB가 근본적인 삼원색이며</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">이를 줄여가며 설명하는 방식을 </span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">살짝 변형시켜 더해가며 설명하는 형식으로 바꾼 것이</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">CMY(색의 삼원색)에 해당된다</span></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/52b29614b3550d1c4523a6ee6bb066d6ee5cb55d\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/52b29614b3550d1c4523a6ee6bb066d6ee5cb55d\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"417\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">즉, ^^</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f6e218d8ad87668e81b95e0086a83b7003d55134\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f6e218d8ad87668e81b95e0086a83b7003d55134\" data-origin-width=\"1686\" data-origin-height=\"629\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>빨간색 박스 2개의 수치가 같으면</b></span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>같은색(위 그림에서는 노랑)이 되어야 하고,</b></span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>이때 오른쪽(감산혼합)은 </b></span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>줄여가는 효과인데,<br>늘리는 효과로 해석하면</b></span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>노랑색(Y)을 늘려가는 효과로 보이기에(흰바탕에 물감색을 칠하는 효과),</b></span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>우리는 더해가는 혼합(색의 삼원색 혼합)이라고 해석한다</b></span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}